<title>USA: Colonial to merge with Great Southern.</title>
<headline>Colonial to merge with Great Southern.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonial BancGroup said Friday it signed a definitive merger agreement to buy Great Southern Bancorp in a merger deal.</p>
<p>Colonial said it will exchange sufficient common stock to equal $13.05 per share for Great Southern's outstanding shares for a total value of $20.76 million. The company will also assume Great Southern options based on the $13.05 price per share, bringing the total value to about $22.6 million.</p>
<p>The company said the parties signed a letter of intent on Feb. 20.</p>
